        "content": "**VMRay: sandbox analysis incomplete** — the file(s) SentinelOne fetched for threat `{{ node.2['events'][0]['sentinelone.threatId'] | string | replace('`', \"'\") }}` did not return a report.{% if node.6['timed_out'] %}\n\nTimed out waiting: submission(s) {{ node.6['pending_submission_ids'] | join(', ') }} may still finish on VMRay.{% endif %}{% if node.6['failed_submission_ids'] %}\n\nFailed submission(s): {{ node.6['failed_submission_ids'] | join(', ') }}.{% endif %}{% if node.6['errors'] %}\n\nErrors:\n{% for e in node.6['errors'] %}\n- {% if e.get('file') %}file `{{ e.get('file') | string | replace('`', \"'\") }}`: {% elif e.get('submission_id') %}submission {{ e.get('submission_id') }}: {% endif %}`{{ (e.get('error_msg') or 'unknown error') | string | replace('`', \"'\") | replace('\\n', ' ') }}`{% endfor %}{% endif %}"
      },
      "action_uuid": "0d323de3-a864-4afe-a0c3-e7ff45883d7a",
      "module_uuid": "92d8bb47-7c51-445d-81de-ae04edbb6f0a"
    },
    "10": {
      "name": "VMRay: Render Report",
